        "created_at": "2026-04-28T14:34:37.968Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Or even better, the cult of Gloom.  Organization at least will always have the Operative and her one shots, but Gloomweaver’s original deck can be reduced to nothing but one Ongoing and three copies of a One-Shot which now reads entirely “Play another villain card”.  Apparently Haka’s stomach is the true Realm of Discord.</p>",
